    {
      "type": "tutorial",
      "heading": "Condition Types",
      "id": "sidebar",
      "intro": "Scenario Studio punya 6 tipe kondisi untuk membangun logika deteksi.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "num": 1,
          "title": "LOGICAL \u2014 AND / OR / NOT / XOR",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n\u2022 **AND** \u2014 Semua kondisi harus terpenuhi\n\u2022 **OR** \u2014 Salah satu kondisi cukup\n\u2022 **NOT** \u2014 Membalikkan hasil kondisi\n\u2022 **XOR** \u2014 Hanya satu yang boleh terpenuhi",
          "color": "#6366f1",
          "bg": "#eef2ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #c7d2fe;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"width:4px;background:#6366f1;flex-shrink:0;\"></div><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;flex:1;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;margin-bottom:6px;\"><span style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">LOGICAL</span><span style=\"padding:2px 6px;border-radius:3px;background:#eef2ff;font-size:6px;font-weight:600;color:#6366f1;\">AND / OR / NOT / XOR</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;flex-wrap:wrap;\"><span style=\"padding:3px 6px;border-radius:4px;background:#f0fdf4;border:1px solid #bbf7d0;font-size:6px;font-weight:600;color:#16a34a;\">Amount > 10jt</span><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7\"/></svg><span style=\"padding:3px 6px;border-radius:4px;background:#f0fdf4;border:1px solid #bbf7d0;font-size:6px;font-weight:600;color:#16a34a;\">Country \u2260 ID</span><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7\"/></svg><span style=\"padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;background:#fef2f2;border:1px solid #fecaca;font-size:6px;font-weight:700;color:#dc2626;\">ALERT</span></div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "CONTAINS \u2014 Pencocokan Teks",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n\u2022 Mencari kata/pola dalam data teks\n\u2022 Cocok untuk: nomor rekening, alamat, deskripsi transaksi\n\u2022 Mendukung case-sensitive dan case-insensitive",
          "color": "#10b981",
          "bg": "#f0fdf4",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #a7f3d0;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\"><div style=\"width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:6px;background:#10b981;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M21 15a2 2 0 01-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 012-2h14a2 2 0 012 2z\"/></svg></div><div><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">CONTAINS</div><div style=\"font-size:7px;color:#64748b;\">Pencocokan teks dalam data</div></div></div><div style=\"padding:4px 10px 8px;font-size:7px;color:#475569;font-family:monospace;background:#f0fdf4;margin:0 8px 8px;border-radius:4px;\">message CONTAINS \"transfer\"</div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 3,
          "title": "CONSTANT \u2014 Perbandingan Nilai",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n\u2022 Membandingkan nilai data dengan angka tetap\n\u2022 Operator: =, !=, >, >=, <, <=\n\u2022 Tipe paling sering dipakai",
          "color": "#f59e0b",
          "bg": "#fffbeb",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #fde68a;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\"><div style=\"width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:6px;background:#f59e0b;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M4 17h16M4 12h16M4 7h16\"/></svg></div><div><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">CONSTANT</div><div style=\"font-size:7px;color:#64748b;\">Perbandingan dengan nilai tetap</div></div></div><div style=\"padding:4px 10px 8px;display:flex;gap:4px;\"><span style=\"padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;background:#fff7ed;border:1px solid #fde68a;font-size:7px;font-weight:600;color:#92400e;\">amount > 10000000</span><span style=\"padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;background:#fff7ed;border:1px solid #fde68a;font-size:7px;font-weight:600;color:#92400e;\">currency = IDR</span></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 4,
          "title": "DEVIATION \u2014 Deteksi Penyimpangan",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n\u2022 Mendeteksi perubahan dari nilai normal berdasarkan persentase\n\u2022 Cocok untuk: lonjakan transaksi, perubahan pola spending\n\u2022 Contoh: transaksi naik 200% dari rata-rata 7 hari",
          "color": "#ef4444",
          "bg": "#fef2f2",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #fecaca;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\"><div style=\"width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:6px;background:#ef4444;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M13 2L3 14h9l-1 8 10-12h-9l1-8z\"/></svg></div><div><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">DEVIATION</div><div style=\"font-size:7px;color:#64748b;\">Deteksi penyimpangan dari normal</div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 5,
          "title": "AGGREGATE \u2014 Hitung / Total / Rata",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n\u2022 **Count** \u2014 Jumlah transaksi (contoh: > 50 transaksi/jam)\n\u2022 **Sum** \u2014 Total nilai (contoh: > 500jt/hari)\n\u2022 **Rate** \u2014 Frekuensi (contoh: 5 transaksi/menit)",
          "color": "#7c3aed",
          "bg": "#f5f3ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #ddd6fe;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\"><div style=\"width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:6px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#7c3aed,#6366f1);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M2 20h20M5 17V9m5 8V5m5 12v-6m5 6v-4\"/></svg></div><div><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">AGGREGATE</div><div style=\"font-size:7px;color:#64748b;\">Count, Sum, Rate, Avg</div></div></div><div style=\"padding:4px 10px 8px;display:flex;gap:4px;\"><span style=\"padding:2px 6px;border-radius:3px;background:#f5f3ff;font-size:6px;font-weight:600;color:#7c3aed;\">Count > 50/jam</span><span style=\"padding:2px 6px;border-radius:3px;background:#f5f3ff;font-size:6px;font-weight:600;color:#7c3aed;\">Sum > 500jt/hari</span><span style=\"padding:2px 6px;border-radius:3px;background:#f5f3ff;font-size:6px;font-weight:600;color:#7c3aed;\">Ratio > 5/menit</span></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 6,
          "title": "GEO \u2014 Deteksi Berdasarkan Lokasi",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n\u2022 **Geo IP** \u2014 Negara/kota asal transaksi\n\u2022 **Geo Distance** \u2014 Jarak antara dua lokasi\n\u2022 **Geo Contains** \u2014 Apakah titik dalam area tertentu",
          "color": "#2563eb",
          "bg": "#eff6ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #bfdbfe;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\"><div style=\"width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:6px;background:#2563eb;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M12 2a15 15 0 010 20 15 15 0 010-20z\"/><path d=\"M2 12h20\"/></svg></div><div><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">GEO</div><div style=\"font-size:7px;color:#64748b;\">Deteksi berdasarkan lokasi geografis</div></div></div><div style=\"padding:4px 10px 8px;display:flex;gap:4px;\"><span style=\"padding:2px 6px;border-radius:3px;background:#eff6ff;font-size:6px;font-weight:600;color:#2563eb;\">\ud83c\udf10 Geo IP</span><span style=\"padding:2px 6px;border-radius:3px;background:#eff6ff;font-size:6px;font-weight:600;color:#2563eb;\">\u2194 Geo Distance</span><span style=\"padding:2px 6px;border-radius:3px;background:#eff6ff;font-size:6px;font-weight:600;color:#2563eb;\">\u25a2 Geo Contains</span></div></div>"
